# Exact cargo-mutants output lines for reviewed equivalent mutants only.
# Every entry must have a nearby issue/reason in the review record. Broad
# globs, package-wide exemptions, and unexplained suppressions are forbidden.

# These count guards are equivalent for nonnegative counts: >= 0 is always
# true, and a zero/zero floating ratio is NaN, which is false for both > and >=.
